              "id": "text-14",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium 6Al-4V ELI Grade 23 is produced at a higher purity than Titanium 6Al-4V Grade 5. Though this alloy is mainly recognized as the best dental and medical Titanium grade, it is also widely used in applications when there is a need for toughness, high strength, light weight, and good corrosion resistance."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Because of these unique biocompatibility characteristics, Titanium 6Al-4v ELI Grade 23 is also used in bio-medical applications, implants, and similar surgical procedures and situations."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium 6Al-4V ELI Grade 23 Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "AMS: AMS 4907, AMS 4930, AMS 4931, AMS 4956"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "ASTM: ASTM F467, ASTM F468"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "MIL: MIL F-83142, MIL T-9046, MIL T-9047"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium 6Al-4V ELI Grade 23 products offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium 6Al-4V ELI Grade 23 Round Bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-titanium-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium 6Al-4V ELI Grade 23 Plate](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-titanium-plate)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium 6Al-4V Grade 5 Sheet](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-titanium-sheet)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium 6Al-4V ELI Grade 23 Bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-titanium-rectangular-bar)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
